{%- comment -%}
  Mystery boxes only: optional "what I like" and "books I already own" boxes. Whatever the customer types is saved
  on the order as line item properties, so it shows on the packing order and the book helper uses it to pick the box.
  Left blank = random assortment. Partner products and normal books never see it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign t = product.title | downcase -%}
{%- unless product.tags contains 'Shopify Collective' -%}{%- if product.available -%}
{%- if t contains 'mystery' or t contains 'blind date with manga' -%}
{%- assign line = settings.field_border_color | default: '#70b1cc' -%}
<div class="tme-owned" style="margin:0 0 1rem;padding:12px 14px;border:2px dashed {{ line }};border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.6);text-align:left">
  <label for="tme-likes-{{ product.id }}" style="display:block;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px">✨ What do you (or they) love?</label>
  <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:.95em">Tell us favorite genres, series or vibes and we'll pick books to match. Optional!</p>
  <textarea id="tme-likes-{{ product.id }}" name="properties[What I like]" rows="2" maxlength="1000" placeholder="e.g. cozy romance, fantasy, anything like Spy x Family, no horror" style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font:inherit;font-size:16px;padding:8px;border:1px solid {{ line }};border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:12px"></textarea>
  <label for="tme-owned-{{ product.id }}" style="display:block;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px">Want to avoid books you already own?</label>
  <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:.95em">Paste your collection list here (series and volumes) and we'll make sure your box doesn't include any books you already have. If you use our My Manga Emporium app, we check your app shelf too. Buying it as a gift? If you leave this blank, don't worry: you'll get a random assortment of amazing manga!</p>
  <textarea id="tme-owned-{{ product.id }}" name="properties[Books I already own]" rows="4" maxlength="5000" placeholder="e.g. Naruto 1–20, Spy x Family 1–5, all of Fruits Basket…" style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font:inherit;font-size:16px;padding:8px;border:1px solid {{ line }};border-radius:6px"></textarea>
</div>
{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}{%- endunless -%}
